  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jitul Deka vs The State Of Assam And 5 Ors on 25 November, 2020 Author: Manish Choudhury Bench: Manish Choudhury Page No.# 1/3 Gahc010035402020 The Gauhati High Court (High Court Of Assam, Nagaland, Mizoram And Arunachal Pradesh) Case No. : Pil/19/2020 Jitul Deka General Secretary, Asomiya Yuva Mancha, S/O- Sri Karuna Deka, At At Telecom, Kunja Commercial Complex, Maligaon, Guwahati, Assam, Pin- 781012 Versus The State Of Assam And 5 Ors Rep. By Chief Secretary, Govt Of Assam, Dispur, Guwahati 2:The Director 3:The Joint Director 4:The Commissioner 5:Vishnu Aromatics Ltd 6:Kamakhya Pan Products Pvt Lt Advocate for the Petitioner : Mr. A Goyal Advocate for the Respondent : Sc, Health Page Jitul Deka vs The State Of Assam And 5 Ors on 25 November, 2020 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/6937609/ 1 Before Hon'Ble The Chief Justice (Acting) Mr. N. Kotiswar Singh Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Manish Choudhury :: O R D E R :",
    "facts": "2. In this PIL, the matter relates to presence of Magnesium Carbonate in the various brands of Pan Masala being sold in the market, which is a highly toxic component and injurious to health.",
    "arguments": "3. In this regard, it has been submitted by Mr. K. Goswami, learned counsel for the respondent No. 6 that there is an alternative dispute resolution forum available under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 in the form of Adjudication and Food Safety Appellate Tribunal appointed under Section 68 of the Act. The learned counsel for the petitioner has also agreed about the existence of such forum and is willing to pursue the issues raised herein before the said forum.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. In this regard, it has been submitted by Mr. K. Goswami, learned counsel for the respondent No. 6 that there is an alternative dispute resolution forum available under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 in the form of Adjudication and Food Safety Appellate Tribunal appointed under Section 68 of the Act. The learned counsel for the petitioner has also agreed about the existence of such forum and is willing to pursue the issues raised herein before the said forum.",
